description: Inspector project context — architecture, status, and non-obvious decisions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before making changes. It is the index for this
project: what it is, where we are, and where the non-obvious decisions that must not be "fixed"
live — one file per area in `docs/decisions/`.

Before changing a module, read the `AGENTS.md` in its directory and the decision files it names.
`CLAUDE.md` beside each is a symlink to it. Keep one copy of each decision; never duplicate one.
